<title>UK: OPEC basket price jumped 70 cts to $19.00 on Monday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price jumped 70 cts to $19.00 on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes rose to $19.00 a barrel on Monday from $18.30 a barrel on Friday, according to the OPEC Secretariat's calculations, the OPEC news agency said.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
